COMMENTS OF NORTHEASTERN REMC  
ON THE ORDER INSTITUTING THE PROCEEDING  
UNDER SECTION 206 OF THE FEDERAL POWER ACT  
AND CONSOLIDATING WITH OTHER PROCEEDINGS 

Pursuant to Rule 212 of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission’s (“Commission”) 
Rules of Practice and Procedure1,  Northeastern Rural Electric Membership Corporation 
(“NREMC”) respectfully submits these comments to the Order Instituting Proceeding Under 
Section 206 of the Federal Power Act and Consolidating with Other Proceedings2 issued in the 
above-captioned proceeding on February 20, 2025.  

1 18 C.F.R § 385.212. 
2 PJM Interconnection, L.L.C., Order Instituting Proceeding Under Section 206 of the Federal Power Act and 
Consolidating with Other Proceedings, Docket Nos. EL25-49-000, et al. (Feb. 20, 2025) (“Show Cause Order”).
